{"id":"UZ91Hn1hmVR2dYP","name":"medieval_npc_spawn","type":"sequence","entries":[{"id":"0ENHZ40MxLu7uci","name":"sound_during_medieval_talking","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"value":"music.overworld.badlands","type":"default"},"track":"RECORD","soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":""}},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"K4fLDSbmzviuWe6","name":"interact_with_npc","triggers":["0BFn7BwpkZ01BZG","kPYKF8FhhoPLl3M","nUXHlIk0mJQLoXu","CbSLAihWOkdfUGI","3WdM52wP7HkxHUw","jjw9Ic36E7UYRq0","jbomnvtnwDda5Vw","Cb27brLe0Vyhlr7","HiKRkf3hlrHsOaS"],"definition":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","shiftType":"ANY","interactionType":"ALL","type":"entity_interact_event","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"iOyHU9vrtp1HcBJ","name":"first_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Lo que queda del Imperio —ruinas, maleza y almas que no terminan de irse. Tú eres una de ellas, por cierto.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"PfZXA4le9WpgCUW","name":"second_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Un guardia que ya perdió la cuenta de cuántos ha visto levantarse del suelo como tú. No me pagan, no me ascienden… y aun así sigo vigilando.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"TNxe9YQeyLwJ1jx","name":"third_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Mueres, y la Maleza te devuelve. Cada vez un poco distinto, cada vez con menos recuerdos. Aprende algo antes de la próxima, ¿quieres?","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"kPYKF8FhhoPLl3M","name":"firsts_options","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[{"fact":"lb1ix6O6aDeGigd","operator":"=","value":1}],"triggers":[],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Vigía del Reino, testigo de los que reviven","options":[{"text":"<#F86363>✦ Informar de la entrada","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":5},{"fact":"MrTW5VR1etSalHt","operator":">=","value":30}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["PcNQTcjQMSDgn1L"]},{"text":"<#F86363>✦ Sobre la entrada de Orian…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":5},{"fact":"MrTW5VR1etSalHt","operator":"<","value":30}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["pqR4SklwbzkhHza"]},{"text":"<#F86363>✦ Aldric ha recordado al Alquimista","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":13}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["1NKRDSxnGcdVcGn"]},{"text":"<#F86363>✦ La noche ha terminado","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":14},{"fact":"g2XmU0CcvCWiE4h","operator":">=","value":10},{"fact":"R5Tim8FyzJagWfg","operator":">=","value":12},{"fact":"WaBBg45YU9y7drN","operator":">=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["GVX071eHcn6KSt0"]},{"text":"<#F86363>✦ Sobre la Noche de la Maleza…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":14}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["zBrKVBQ3dK2osEB"]},{"text":"<#7FD8FF>⛨ Proteger mi terreno","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["RdHtmHvLUbHdl0n"]},{"text":"¿Qué es este lugar?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["iOyHU9vrtp1HcBJ"]},{"text":"¿Quién eres tú?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["PfZXA4le9WpgCUW"]},{"text":"¿Por qué sigo volviendo?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["TNxe9YQeyLwJ1jx"]},{"text":"Háblame del Rey Draemir...","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["KLikJgOeR4tBwhk"]},{"text":"¿Algún consejo para sobrevivir?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["McTCTMTFdFkMfXS"]}],"duration":1000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"nUXHlIk0mJQLoXu","name":"stop_all_sounds_first_on_npc","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["0ENHZ40MxLu7uci"],"sound":{"enabled":false,"value":{"type":"default","value":""}},"type":"stop_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"KLikJgOeR4tBwhk","name":"lore_guardia_rey","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"El Rey Draemir quiso vivir para siempre. Bebió de la raíz que crecía bajo el trono y la Maleza le respondió. Ahora sueña despierto, y sus sueños caminan por los pasillos. Yo me quedé fuera —cobardía, lo llaman algunos—. Yo lo llamo seguir vivo.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"McTCTMTFdFkMfXS","name":"lore_guardia_consejo","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Nada de lo que lleves encima es para siempre; lo que aprendas, sí. Explora, cae, levántate… y procura caer menos que ayer.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"CbSLAihWOkdfUGI","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_guardia","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#FFB347>✦ <#C9CDD6>Primero habla con <yellow>King Draemir","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"3WdM52wP7HkxHUw","name":"tutorial_guardia_presentacion","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"<=","value":4}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["xpn23wSblag6BOD"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Vaya… has revivido —otra vez. La Maleza nunca suelta del todo a los suyos. El Rey ya te contó su parte; yo me encargo de que no vuelvas a caer con las manos vacías.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"xpn23wSblag6BOD","name":"tutorial_guardia_mision","criteria":[],"modifiers":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"=","value":6},{"fact":"lb1ix6O6aDeGigd","operator":"=","value":1},{"fact":"26auCJp8cHzlQEW","operator":"=","value":4}],"triggers":["JSugiYpCAK66OYT","7LjLAQhsf4thCFE","u5dUiZnj6CDJgnN"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Toma: un suit de cuero, herramientas de piedra, algo de comida y una manzana dorada para los malos momentos. No es gran cosa, pero la última vez saliste con menos. Y llévate estas monedas: ahí fuera nadie regala nada.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"u5dUiZnj6CDJgnN","name":"tutorial_guardia_portal_fin","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["mRsHdRXfr8nBNXY"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Ahora busca el <#5FE3FF>Portal</#5FE3FF>; el rastro blanco te llevará. Te lanzará a un lugar al azar del mundo. Y si caes —bueno, ya sabes cómo funciona esto— volverás.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"snggHrWyzjxXwFm","name":"tutorial_titulo_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"title":"<#5FE3FF>Usa el Portal","subtitle":"<#C9CDD6>Salta al Portal","durations":{"enabled":true,"value":{"fadeIn":500,"stay":3500,"fadeOut":800}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"JSugiYpCAK66OYT","name":"tutorial_sonido_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"block.portal.ambient"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.5,"pitch":1.6},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"7LjLAQhsf4thCFE","name":"tutorial_consola_paso_6","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"tutorial paso %player_name% 6","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"jjw9Ic36E7UYRq0","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_guardia_portal","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#5FE3FF>✦ <#C9CDD6>Salta al <#5FE3FF>portal<#C9CDD6> para terminar","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"n8nOz27vGPuKaGm","name":"tutorial_suit_inicial","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"itemdar %player_name% 1 leather helmet\nitemdar %player_name% 1 leather chestplate\nitemdar %player_name% 1 leather leggings\nitemdar %player_name% 1 leather boots\nitemdar %player_name% 1 stone sword\nitemdar %player_name% 1 stone pickaxe\nitemdar %player_name% 1 stone axe\nitemdar %player_name% 32 cooked beef\nitemdar %player_name% 1 golden apple","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"SaWHGOKxG8pKHBJ","name":"tutorial_suit_monedas","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"amount":1000.0,"type":"deposit_balance","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"wJq13TcoKBzDPhY","name":"tutorial_titulo_suit","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"title":"<#FFD36B>Suit Inicial","subtitle":"<#7FFF9E>+2000 Monedas","durations":{"enabled":true,"value":{"fadeIn":400,"stay":3000,"fadeOut":600}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"D5nlo0Laa8nzFTk","name":"tutorial_sonido_suit","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"item.armor.equip_leather"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":1,"pitch":1},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"jbomnvtnwDda5Vw","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_guardia_eco","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":2}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#FFB347>✦ <#C9CDD6>Primero encuentra el <#7FB2FF>Eco de los Recuerdos <dark_gray>(sigue el rastro)","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"mRsHdRXfr8nBNXY","name":"tutorial_cinematica_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["n8nOz27vGPuKaGm","SaWHGOKxG8pKHBJ","wJq13TcoKBzDPhY","D5nlo0Laa8nzFTk","CbvaQqrpxCCduFx","Fv3il5Qf5ORrK0t","7XA6qReaun3ztI6"],"blockChatMessages"